{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2026-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1780876800, "end_date": 1781567999, "month_true_total": 2447, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:09:25 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "228063863", "author": {"steamid": "76561198765287109", "personaname": "Dutty", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198765287109/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 18888, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 18795, "last_played": 1787695301, "avatar": "1f9b3eaac394714cd43be79e490ba298f34dafe1"}, "language": "english", "review": "The first free to play game i've ever seen thats ACTUALLY FREE TO PLAY. no seriously, literally everything can be gotten for free. Even the premium currency of the game itself. You can't even pay to upgrade the battle pass even if you wanted to lol.\r\n\r\n The gameplay is fun and addicting which is perfect for a game all about grinding for things. Easily the most content i've ever seen a game have, there's always something to do. The story and the sidequests are unecessarily good. Like REALLY GOOD. also the soundtrack is so amazing for no reason whatsoever.\r\n\r\n The dev team is one of the best a game could have. never thought id see a company live by the rule of \"you don't have to pay us but you can if you want to.\" Also don't even get me started on the character power designs. overwatch and marvel rivals could never. if your curious on what the characters designs look like, just search up \"Gauss Prime Trailer\" on youtube and feast your eyes on peak. \r\n\r\n9.7/10 def give it a shot. after all, its free :D", "timestamp_created": 1781567019, "timestamp_updated": 1781567019, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_earl